From a1e52cc8e65e6ea40a9de887c834211ee4e17cdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amalgamator Bench <amalgamator-bench@redhat.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:50:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] expat-cve-2025-59375-c8s: apply
 cve-2025-59375-upstream.patch

This CentOS Stream 8 dist-git checkout of expat (2.2.5, plus downstream patches) is affected by CVE-2025-59375: while parsing, expat can be made to allocate unbounded dynamic memory (memory amplification). The upstream fix is provided as a patch against the vendored upstream tree on branch 'upstream-base': /workspace/upstream-fix/cve-2025-59375-upstream.patch.
Backport the fix onto branch 'target' so that the package builds and its complete test suite passes.

